@host = http://localhost:5000
@api = {{host}}/api/v1

### Health - anonymous
GET {{host}}/health

### Sign in as the seeded administrator - the requests below reuse its token
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrUsername": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Who am I
GET {{api}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Users (Admin only)
GET {{api}}/users?isActive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Items - an Admin reads every item, everyone else their own
GET {{api}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The dashboard figures for the signed-in role
GET {{api}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
